{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2024-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1708041600, "end_date": 1708732799, "month_true_total": 2283, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:26:52 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "159101282", "author": {"steamid": "76561198971227053", "personaname": "patxi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198971227053/", "num_games_owned": 99, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1810, "last_played": 1720289895, "avatar": "360236e555049f204b12d3a8685a3b9b9764ebfe"}, "language": "english", "review": "karl is my boy", "timestamp_created": 1708732462, "timestamp_updated": 1708732462, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159100214", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099352373", "personaname": "Star Platinum", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GeneralSpecific/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 24751, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13959, "last_played": 1769053002, "avatar": "c60b0d554059f4187dfecdab8b09678a432f07d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game really grew on me. It's a fun, quirky first person shooter that provides exploration, customizable loudouts, plenty of cosmetics to unlock (the vast majority of which can be acquired without DLC), and the choice to either tackle a mission alone, invite friends and coordinate abilities, or join an online game. Each of the four dwarf classes feel distinct from one another, and encourages cooperation with other players. The weapons and equipment have great customization options between the selectable perks and \"overclocks\" which provide substantially different effects that change the way you use them.\n\nWhile the mission types and objectives start to feel recycled after a while, the maps are randomly generated to offer a new-ish experience every time. Every once in a while, it will toss in a random event or chest to unlock an upgrade or cosmetic.\n\nOverall it's worth checking out, and would definitely recommend it to a group looking for a cooperative multi-player experience, or for lone wolves who want to tackle a cavern themselves. Have it your way like BK.", "timestamp_created": 1708731325, "timestamp_updated": 1708731325, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159099124", "author": {"steamid": "76561199048990982", "personaname": "Buzz Goober", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/trickynorton/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1192, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 917, "last_played": 1724109576, "avatar": "8fef963ef9da1816f358d941d326a8c932e415aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you rock and stone, you'll never be alone.", "timestamp_created": 1708730223, "timestamp_updated": 1708730223, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159098845", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972611304", "personaname": "Vodune", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.c